stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Journal: unfinished_handoff, an input leads the queue
    Journal --> Dropped: channel left Herdr AND (old pane ended OR original gone) / drop journal
    Dropped --> Submitted: ordinary path reserves the front once
    Journal --> Backoff: a refusal no later look clears / the front's count + deadline
    Backoff --> Journal: 2,4,8,16 seconds / timer wake
    Journal --> Closing: mapped channel, Herdr host / any front continues the pinned close
    Closing --> Backoff: close failed / the front's count, drive timer
    Closing --> Ended: old pane confirmed ended
    Ended --> Submitted: front of the journal's session / one Herdr reserve consumes the journal
    Ended --> Finished: front of another session, original gone / finish journal
    Finished --> Submitted: the front reserves on its own target
    Backoff --> Retained: fifth counted hold / original + notice intent in one commit
    Retained --> Custody: journal unended / id and pin kept, budget emptied, no timer
    Retained --> NextHead: journal ended or channel left Herdr / journal dropped
    Custody --> Journal: next input leads / it spends its own budget
    Journal --> Custody: cancel or cancel-all removes the inputs / budget emptied
    Custody --> [*]: session reset gives the custody up
    Submitted --> [*]
    NextHead --> [*]: deduplicated visible failure notice
